    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d250">

                <pb facs="0417" n="321" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg321"/>

                <head>No. 250.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Shepard to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United
                                States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Japan</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1872-02-17"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 17, 1872</date>. (Received
                        April 1.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 19.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: His Majesty the Tenno, on Japanese new
                    year, (February 10,) for the first time received the foreign representatives in
                    a body. Congratulations were exchanged with his ministers, and through the prime
                    minister the Emperor asked particularly after the health of the President.</p>
                <p>Herewith I hand you copy of His Majesty’s speech.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CHARLES O. SHEPARD,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé d’ Affaires ad
                            int.</hi></signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d250-a1.xml" xpointer="d250-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
